%% Dynamic view - image admission and Confirm Image
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Clinician
  participant UI as Clinician UI (Worklist)
  participant API as Review API
  participant ADM as services/admission.py
  participant RES as services/resolver.py
  participant DB as Workspace SQLite
  C->>UI: Scan input folder
  UI->>API: POST /v1/admissions/scan
  API->>ADM: scan_input_folder(input_folder)
  ADM->>ADM: top-level files only - skip ancillary .csv/.json/.md
  ADM->>ADM: decode, SHA-256, format check, coarse fundus/quality screen
  ADM-->>API: AdmissionMetadata per file (+ duplicate aliases)
  API->>DB: store admission + AUTOMATIC_ADMISSION history
  UI->>API: GET /v1/cases
  API->>RES: resolve(filename) - anchored patterns, optional OCR
  RES-->>API: patient / eye candidates (evidence only)
  API-->>UI: rows with plain-language status
  C->>UI: Confirm Image (patient key, eye, reviewer)
  UI->>API: POST /v1/cases/{id}/confirm-image
  API->>DB: laterality method MANUAL, reviewer, timestamp, revision+1
